02:35:20.803 --> 02:35:23.138
Casals? JJ?

02:35:24.057 --> 02:35:25.265
Drucker, JJ?

02:35:25.433 --> 02:35:27.976
<i>Aku ada di lobby dekat tangga.</i>

02:35:28.144 --> 02:35:29.144
Bagaimana keadaannya?

02:35:29.312 --> 02:35:32.481
<i>Satu tim naik dengan lift lain
ke lantai 17.</i>

02:35:32.649 --> 02:35:34.816
<i>Semua lift tak berfungsi
karena alarm kebakaran.</i>

02:35:34.984 --> 02:35:38.111
<i>Kacau. Orang di mana-mana./</i>
Baik, dimengerti.

02:36:07.934 --> 02:36:09.518
Ayo, minggir.

02:36:09.686 --> 02:36:11.603
Lewat sana.

02:36:19.529 --> 02:36:22.572
Ayo, lewat sana.
Kita harus pergi, Ayo.

02:36:25.702 --> 02:36:27.619
Aku mengerti, Pak.

02:36:29.747 --> 02:36:31.665
Ayo.

02:36:37.505 --> 02:36:39.131
Ayo, Pak.

02:36:43.386 --> 02:36:46.388
Hati-hati, Nyonya.

02:36:49.058 --> 02:36:50.726
Teruslah berjalan, Nyonya.

02:36:51.561 --> 02:36:52.644
Ayo.

02:36:55.148 --> 02:36:56.398
Ayo, cepat.

02:37:31.017 --> 02:37:32.684
Lewat sini, Nyonya.

02:37:34.645 --> 02:37:36.438
Mundur, mundur.

02:38:02.298 --> 02:38:04.716
Berikan senjata itu padaku./
Ya, Pak.

02:44:22.178 --> 02:44:24.929
Sudah kubilang,
aku takkan kembali ke penjara.

02:44:28.267 --> 02:44:29.893
Ya.

